  "body": "@zcorpan is fine with this, but he would like to preserve history, which may be tricky as the `<picture>` repository includes all of the HTML history.\n\nAlso, if we preserve history, we probably want to disable tweeting for a while as it would be quite the flood.\n\nAnyway, things to be done:\n- [x] inline the build script input into `source`\n- [x] update the build script to no longer care for `<picture>`\n- [x] point out that part of the history regarding images is elsewhere\n- [ ] ~~point out that part of the history regarding images is licensed under CC0~~\n- [x] move section 4.8.2 dependencies to a better location\n- [x] mention `<piccture>` in more places, https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=27570\n- [x] merge acknowledgments, https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=26146\n- [x] explain `<img sizes>`\n- [x] explain `<img media>`\n- [x] explain `<img srcset>`\n- [x] merge descriptions of `<source>` elements\n",
